    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "jo",
        "speaker": "Jo",
        "sourceStart": 4,
        "sourceEnd": 70,
        "text": "How was your interview at the neighborhood museum on Friday, Rina?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "2db5fe18a9b93498f2d7746feb86c0c46d8e9855e19133e4797f208e4b5aa19a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "rina",
        "speaker": "Rina",
        "sourceStart": 77,
        "sourceEnd": 179,
        "text": "It was interesting. I went at eleven in the morning and spoke to the manager of the events department.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "9d276d52f87aac5de8b276e182e77f0af5bace6605dbf7f1677bcdc18b58571a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "jo",
        "speaker": "Jo",
        "sourceStart": 184,
        "sourceEnd": 216,
        "text": "What position did you apply for?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "a6b757e2366541e6059a5325be1cafdc1bdba5b1e2a096eb3e461e4e25f48bb2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "rina",
        "speaker": "Rina",
        "sourceStart": 223,
        "sourceEnd": 370,
        "text": "The vacancy was for a weekend workshop assistant. I sent the application on Wednesday. The employer wanted someone to help visitors find materials.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "fc18203eff1a694bc92bb1bc513f3e9367f674c6e49a10c0650f9e60720c510c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "jo",
        "speaker": "Jo",
        "sourceStart": 375,
        "sourceEnd": 418,
        "text": "Did you give an example of your experience?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "a92362ef64602288043902f27cb838666166ea286781484b6806923f2499c50f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "rina",
        "speaker": "Rina",
        "sourceStart": 425,
        "sourceEnd": 625,
        "text": "Yes. I described a garden event where my colleague and I worked as a team. I showed a certificate from a short art course as one qualification. I also brought a copy of my application for the manager.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "2c0939cdac6a1761d23c9bcc5192919521519cb8f2b8d541c524482143892e5c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "jo",
        "speaker": "Jo",
        "sourceStart": 630,
        "sourceEnd": 654,
        "text": "What did they ask about?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "d4bf6eb4960b43dc8d82860ddc27894ca6cfa17c98c42a9f8243d7f1681d593c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "rina",
        "speaker": "Rina",
        "sourceStart": 661,
        "sourceEnd": 797,
        "text": "They asked how I would help a customer who arrived late. I said I would listen, check the task list and ask an employee if I was unsure.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "44e806156fb18f58b708fbee91c965b1185f756205708ed81bbebc980638bb7a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "jo",
        "speaker": "Jo",
        "sourceStart": 802,
        "sourceEnd": 827,
        "text": "Did they explain the pay?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "9818d353d58d6a12df3e732d7dfe7bad964fcc1d54ecc5d2b8dc2ebed23fcc12",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "rina",
        "speaker": "Rina",
        "sourceStart": 834,
        "sourceEnd": 969,
        "text": "Yes. The hourly wage was fourteen pounds. The manager also mentioned a monthly salary, but that was for a different full-time position.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "282a14dc912a3aec5cf4301c7660fc5dfcf81660429a83168f529bee83d26e8f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "jo",
        "speaker": "Jo",
        "sourceStart": 974,
        "sourceEnd": 1014,
        "text": "Did you get a decision at the interview?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "45ac4e50ed326d9743d506f46514c39496961b916f449193b505ed5072892040",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "rina",
        "speaker": "Rina",
        "sourceStart": 1021,
        "sourceEnd": 1145,
        "text": "No. They will contact each candidate next Tuesday. My goal was to speak clearly, and I felt successful in giving my example.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "f4deab56bdd2ced52e6fa28ddc78f1f74f66f23c27b17673a036a9ba70c695e5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "jo",
        "speaker": "Jo",
        "sourceStart": 1150,
        "sourceEnd": 1182,
        "text": "What will you do while you wait?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "2d11f81d4349174a1a505a8ac8f6f4e580fbc147537615eb9686005a08e64f3a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "rina",
        "speaker": "Rina",
        "sourceStart": 1189,
        "sourceEnd": 1318,
        "text": "I will resume my library volunteering on Sunday. I enjoy that service, and I want to build a reliable work routine for my career.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "56cfcc44c1d5e99296df9a608233c05a99b6731376508055acfeeab4ff5c8c68",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "jo",
        "speaker": "Jo",
        "sourceStart": 1323,
        "sourceEnd": 1366,
        "text": "Did you ask about the first responsibility?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "e0c0e62e928e2c590a85050280de57e7a4b1d2b4e8f71989aeb61e898d44cb62",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "rina",
        "speaker": "Rina",
        "sourceStart": 1373,
        "sourceEnd": 1521,
        "text": "Yes. A new assistant starts by preparing tables before visitors arrive. I wrote it in my notes, because this opportunity could teach me a new skill.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "a37f46ede43d25b6deab6d023989c2cdddd4ee2a204a7e35baaf148abea49313",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      }
    ]
  },
